Description: Simulate ecological niche models using Mahalanobis distance, transform distances to 
    suitability using the empirical cumulative distribution function (ECDF) and the chi-squared. 
    Provides a way to reproduce the use of ECDF in other modeling environments as proposed in Esser 
    et al. (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.ecolmodel.2026.111795>.
